  ID: TheThirdArtifact
  QuestName: The Third Artifact
  Description: With two artifacts secured, I'll have to track down the third and
    final one. Cornelius believes it can be found deep in the mesa ruins, however,
    with the path gone, I'll need to find another way there. An inventor in the maple
    islands may be able to help.
